.TH BOOTSTRAP-OSINT 1 "June 2025" "version 1.0.5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bootstrap-osint.sh \- bootstrap script to set up OSINT and Bash scripting tools in WSL Kali
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bootstrap-osint.sh
[I--cleanupR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
This script automates the installation and setup of essential OSINT tools and
environments for Kali Linux running on WSL. It installs required system packages,
creates Python virtual environments, clones popular OSINT repositories, and
configures the shell environment.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
B--cleanupR
Prompt to remove existing OSINT Python virtual environments and tools before installation.
